{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">藍田麗港城驚現「貼身」泊車奇景。一名搬屋師傅日前在社交平台上載影片，透露自己在麗港城屋苑讓車處停泊貨車，並放下尾板準備搬運貨物，怎料期間有一輛掛着P牌的私家車突然前來「食位」，更硬生生停泊在貨車正後方。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-29-10h37m06s971.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026My2ViKwtUg1790650849.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-29-10h37m06s971.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">由於私家車車頭正正貼緊尾板位置，導致貨車既無法收回或使用尾板，亦無法駛離現場，完全陷入動彈不得的窘境。面對如此奇景，搬屋司機只能大嘆：「你話死唔死？依家啲人玩到咁。」後續上載的影片顯示，有警員到場了解，該輛涉事的P牌私家車最終開車離開。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-29-10h37m09s010.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026ICumtU4AQU1790650835.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-29-10h37m09s010.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">不少網民指P牌司機缺乏公德心，直言：「玩到咁絕」、「都幾冇品」、「叫管理處鎖車啦」。亦有部分網民大發幽默本色，紛紛對P牌司機的精準車距表示「驚嘆」，留言稱：「佢又泊得幾好喎」、「位置泊得啱啱好」。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-29-10h37m50s493.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026IRPDpdwQrn1790650842.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-29-10h37m50s493.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T03:39:50.367071+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}